<title>NEW ZEALAND: Telecom buys back at NZ$6.94/95 per shr.</title>
<headline>Telecom buys back at NZ$6.94/95 per shr.</headline>
<dateline>AUCKLAND 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telecom Corp of New Zealand Ltd said it had bought back 412,800 shares on Thursday at NZ$6.94 and $6.95 per share.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64-4-4734746)</p>
</text>
